/-!
# Source-generated capacity reopening root

The root keeps ledger, UBI-renewal, inquiry, answer and consumer authority in
separate projections.  Its law surface remains root semantic; the positive
actionable-exit witness is generated by the event's periodic UBI source and
does not alter the three zero-budget ledger rows.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14SourceGeneratedContributionCapacityReopeningRoot

noncomputable section

open ResponsibilityLifecycle LivingLawEvolution ConstructiveRoot
open ConstructiveRoot.RootInquiryCompletion
